    {
      "question": "What does \"This card in your hand cannot be played by effects.\" mean?",
      "answer": "It means that you cannot play this card using any effects that play cards from your hand, such as the [On Play] effect of \"ST12-003 Dracule Mihawk\". You can still play it from your hand by paying its cost as usual, and you can also play it using an effect from a place other than your hand, such as your trash.",
